libmustache
------------------------------------------
C++ implementation of Mustache

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmustache-devel-0.6.2-1bl1
  libmustache6-0.6.2-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libyaml-devel-0.2.5-1
  libyaml0_2-0.2.5-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libyaml-devel-0.2.5-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  nlohmann_json-3.12.0-1bl3

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/jbboehr/libmustache

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/jbboehr/libmustache.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libmustache-0.6.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libmustache-0.6.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libmustache-0.6.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmustache-0.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmustache6-0.6.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmustache-devel-0.6.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libmustache)
  /usr/bin/mustachec.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libmustache.README
  /usr/share/doc/libmustache/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/libmustache/README.md

(libmustache6)
  /usr/bin/cygmustache-6.dll

(libmustache-devel)
  /usr/include/mustache/archived_template.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/compiled_template.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/data.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/exception.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/lambda.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/mustache.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/mustache_config.h
  /usr/include/mustache/mustache_export.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/node.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/renderer.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/stack.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/tokenizer.hpp
  /usr/include/mustache/utils.hpp
  /usr/lib/cmake/mustache/mustacheConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/mustache/mustacheConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/mustache/mustacheSharedTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/mustache/mustacheSharedTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libmustache.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/mustache.pc

